{"id":"7ce8c0a8cf5f47cd984dfc088d0ace78","model":"gpt-oss-120b","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"answer\": \"The 17th Street Canal is in New Orleans, Louisiana (forming part of the boundary with Metairie), and the Beaver and Erie Canal is in western Pennsylvania, running from the Ohio River to Lake Erie through several Pennsylvania counties.\",\n  \"citations\": [\n    [\"17th Street Canal\", 0],\n    [\"17th Street Canal\", 3],\n    [\"Beaver and Erie Canal\", 0],\n    [\"Beaver and Erie Canal\", 1]\n  ]\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to answer: \"Where are the 17th Street Canal and the Beaver and Erie Canal located?\" Use evidence.\n\nFrom evidence:\n\n- 17th Street Canal: \"The 17th Street Canal is the largest and most important drainage canal in the city of New Orleans.\" Also \"The canal, along with the Orleans Canal and the London Avenue Canal, form the New Orleans Outfall Canals.\" Also \"The 17th Street Canal forms a significant portion of the boundary between the city of New Orleans and Metairie, Louisiana.\" So location: New Orleans, Louisiana (city) and boundary with Metairie, Louisiana.\n\n- Beaver and Erie Canal: \"The Beaver and Erie Canal, also known as the Erie Extension Canal, was part of the Pennsylvania Canal system...\" and \"The canal ran 136 mi north–south near the western edge of the state from the Ohio River to Lake Erie through Beaver County, Lawrence County, Mercer County, Crawford County, and Erie County, Pennsylvania.\" So location: Pennsylvania, USA (western edge, through those counties). So answer: 17th Street Canal is in New Orleans, Louisiana (boundary with Metairie). Beaver and Erie Canal is in Pennsylvania, running from Ohio River to Lake Erie across several counties.\n\nWe need concise answer string. Something like: \"The 17th Street Canal is in New Orleans, Louisiana (bordering Metairie), and the Beaver and Erie Canal is in western Pennsylvania, running from the Ohio River to Lake Erie through several Pennsylvania counties.\" Provide citations: For 17th Street Canal location: sentence 0 (city of New Orleans) and sentence 3 (boundary with Metairie). For Beaver and Erie Canal location: sentence 0 (part of Pennsylvania Canal system) and sentence 1 (ran ... through ... Pennsylvania counties). Provide list of [title, sentence_id].\n\nThus citations: [\"17th Street Canal\",0], [\"17th Street Canal\",3], [\"Beaver and Erie Canal\",0], [\"Beaver and Erie Canal\",1].\n\nReturn JSON with answer and citations."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":477,"completion_tokens":534,"total_tokens":1011,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791983966,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}